to make a VR work, until now.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.560
With Oculus Quest, you don't need a PC,

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:12.740
you don't need any wires,

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.490
everything you need is right in the box.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.280
The experience of VR is so
much fun just to transport

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.530
yourself into another world.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.580
A huge thank you to Oculus
for sponsoring this video.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.310
I have been looking forward
to checking this out

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:23.470
since it was first announced.

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:26.010
Without further ado,
let's unbox, check it out

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:28.000
and then, I'm going to be going to E3

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.330
to be playing a demo

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.284
of the 360 Beat Saber game.

