00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:09.120
Oculus inside tracking
system is right here.

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:10.930
So these are ultra-wide angle sensors.

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:14.060
It provides room scale tracking
without external sensors.

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:15.800
It's like we've got a charging brick

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.420
